* 0. USER SETTINGS: REPLACE PLACEHOLDERS IF YOUR NIS FILE USES DIFFERENT NAMES
********************************************************************************

* Output folder. Change this path before running if needed.
global OUTDIR "C:/Users/jayma/Downloads/ami_autoimmune_nis_outputs"
cap mkdir "$OUTDIR"
log using "$OUTDIR/ami_autoimmune_analysis.smcl", replace

* NIS variable placeholders. Replace only if your dataset uses different names.
global AGEVAR      "AGE"          // age in years
global SEXVAR      "FEMALE"       // NIS female indicator: 0=male, 1=female
